<glyph name="g" format="2">
  <advance width="683"/>
  <unicode hex="0067"/>
  <note>
Single-storey g with an oval eye and a long gently rising descender, not a square hook.
Weight master: 正文轻体：不是细体到 Regular 的中点。茎 58/48，仍比线性插值更轻，对比开始收回。B 的腰几乎回到参考，M 只轻轻抬谷。字距只加一点空气。
</note>
